Dear Ms. Stanhope,<br />
<br />
The attached letter confirms that Torvane Industrial Group, Inc. withdraws =
the claim presented in our letter of November 14, 2024, in its entirety.<br=
 />
<br />
Our client's current management had no knowledge of the June 9, 2011 corres=
pondence or the signed confirmation letter; neither appears in any system o=
r file transferred at the 2021 acquisition, and the company's own document =
platform holds no correspondence from that era. Having now reviewed the rec=
overed materials, including the October 2013 audit-response correspondence,=
 Torvane accepts that the scope of Prescott Vane's engagement excluded the =
Brandt Thermal warranty matter, and that the election not to pursue that cl=
aim was the company's own, made after advice.<br />
<br />
Torvane reserves no claim arising from the matters described in our Novembe=
r 14 letter.<br />
<br />
Alan Garvey<br />
Garvey Strom LLP
